.Dd November 3, 2026
.Dt MK.HELP.MK 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mk.help.mk
.Nd the help target
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Provides the
.Cm help
target, which prints the current selection, the targets of this role and the
usual variables.
.Pp
Not included directly by a makefile.
.Ss Variables
.Bl -tag -width "BMK_HELP_ROLE"
.It Va BMK_HELP_ROLE
Set by the role file:
.Cm workspace , framework , prog
or
.Cm lib .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mk.framework.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.lib.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.prog.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.workspace.mk 5 ,
.Xr bmake-it 7
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Sylvain Souche
